{"summary":"Turn-based strategy set in the zombie apocalypse.","description":"\"I don't wave around non-words like 'unputdownable' often, but Rebuild deserves it.\" - Touch Arcade (4.5/5) \n\n\"Rebuild is a solid, fun, unique and just plain awesome game.\" - JayIsGames (4.6/5 Best strategy or simulation game) \n\nGAMEPLAY \n\nGather survivors of the zombie apocalypse and defend your fort against undead attacks. Reclaim one building at a time and put your survivors to work scavenging for food, building houses, rediscovering technology and of course killing zombies. \n\nBeware of rival gangs, illness, thieves and even riots as you rebuild a city in this post apocalyptic turn based strategy game. \n\nFEATURES \n\n- Unique turn-based strategy gameplay \n- Randomly generated cities \n- Customizable characters \n- 5 levels of difficulty \n- 7 endings to discover","esrbNotes":"Violence, Blood, Language","pegiNotes":"Horror, Mild Swearing","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Wyb5Jph_QPI?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/MFjndSzsXJbeD-q0pgyJ8iCzfp3--NWg-4JoMU2gpV_wqVQ9_RVetRsMVSdjxRvSFVCF8TyDF-ahdzkuwOxf","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/x6Jn5D7JW_Gx0-pCvHHRdxTCTT3ZoawetPWNudDW4Hn4iJEpfJXsMlr9NKq_-RDXPq6EugE_76ECwZwh6n6Bgw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KYHczOwWeJibJIq5b8-wCBfG2TxZVh3IOTjnMS7EdJu4IumzUQjGnq2mFLOlfFWT4ZIdPLRsN-0YABu8vTLNsQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vRLHb8XEg17u02yrjhnbHGLGPoVcjcNOTj6d3SWayQIAirLK56BBGZ2c592-X2XOXC4jmEXI3I_fHeOcGM2iwA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rQ7oaFTRrXxKcyl8rc-rnccsQii4Ny36JeNvbIEziv-mLn8X5J7SGcfRuV4IgydvWTVkcnyYY51-SzZbCxSuHQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/j6O9YO4uE4p3LXXnZf2KpJUi-xF44lMes1jCGhev9knKKCLJsrAhmLoQzP8MQHKoJ7DX4xNGob27c-0d-xG3Qg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JBQUBA1LMkFo5wFlWoAyGRWbdNLN-9QvblYd8Ghj93M8As_9AOKMj1P4IbqjibUkZrPHwRToDN2Ub24n_OUH","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/